      {
        "id": "f",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Voices plays the Subtractive Synth Voice block once for every note, up to eight at a time, and adds them up, so chords work. The knobs set every voice at once: Cutoff is where the filter rests, Brightness how far each note's envelope opens it, and Release how long a note rings after you let go. Tab into the Synth to see one voice."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
