      {
        "id": "13",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Try this:\n• Add Karplus-Strong String from the Library tab (it arrives as a Voices node) and wire Notes into it instead, for a keyboard of plucked strings.\n• Put a Chord node between Notes and Synth: every key plays a whole chord.\n• Set the Synth's voices to 1 and hold two keys: the newest note steals the voice.\n• Draw your own phrase in the Demo phrase's piano roll.\n• Add an Arpeggiator after Notes, with a Clock (interval 0.25) on its clock.\n• Add a MIDI In, set Notes' Inputs to 4 in the Node tab, and wire it into in_3: a MIDI keyboard plays along too."
        },
        "ui": {
